sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client App
    participant S as Auth Server

    C->>S: GET /parameters
    S->>C: 200 { P, G }

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
    Note over C,S: Commit
    Note over C: x = derive(password, client_id) mod Q
    C->>C: 
    Note over C: r = random in [1, Q-1]
    C->>C: 
    Note over C: t = G^r mod P
    C->>C: 
    C->>S: POST /login/commit  { client_id, commitment_t: t }
    Note over S: binding = H( peer_addr | UA | session_id | client_id | t )
    S->>S: 
    Note over S: c = int(binding) mod Q
    S->>S: 
    S->>C: 200 { session_id, challenge_c: c }
    end

    rect rgb(244, 242, 245)
    Note over C,S: Verify
    Note over C: s = (r + c * x) mod Q
    C->>C: 
    C->>S: POST /login/verify  { solution_s: s }<br/>X-Auth-Session: session_id
    Note over S: G^s == t * y^c  (mod P)
    S->>S: 
    S->>C: 200 { JWT }
    end